{'symbol': 'SYY', 'date': '2023-06-12 08:00:00', 'title': 'TWENTY-FIVE SYSCO DELIVERY PARTNERS NAMED TO INTERNATIONAL FOODSERVICE DISTRIBUTION TRUCK DRIVER HALL OF FAME', 'text': "HOUSTON, JUNE 12, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- SYSCO CORPORATION (NYSE: SYY), THE WORLD'S LARGEST FOOD DISTRIBUTOR, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE INTERNATIONAL FOODSERVICE DISTRIBUTION ASSOCIATION (IFDA) NAMED 25 OF SYSCO'S DELIVERY PARTNERS TO ITS PRESTIGIOUS 2023 TRUCK DRIVER HALL OF FAME."}